<section class="card"><h2>Payment Log</h2><form method="get" class="finance-inline"><input type="hidden" name="page" value="payments"><?php fi('Start Date','start',$paymentLog['start'],'date');fi('End Date','end',$paymentLog['end'],'date');?><label>Direction<select name="direction"><?php foreach(['all'=>'All Payments & Transfers','incoming'=>'Money Received','outgoing'=>'Money Paid Out','transfer'=>'Internal Transfers','adjustment'=>'Recording Adjustments'] as $k=>$label):?><option value="<?=$k?>" <?=$k===$paymentLog['direction']?'selected':''?>><?=access_h($label)?></option><?php endforeach?></select></label><button>Apply Filters</button></form><p>Recorded Incoming Net <?=access_h(fm((int)$paymentLog['totals']['incoming']+(int)$paymentLog['totals']['adjustments']))?> (Original Entries <?=access_h(fm($paymentLog['totals']['incoming']))?>; Recording Adjustments <?=access_h(fm($paymentLog['totals']['adjustments']))?>) · Recorded Outgoing Net <?=access_h(fm((int)$paymentLog['totals']['outgoing']+(int)$paymentLog['totals']['expense_adjustments']+(int)$paymentLog['totals']['payroll_adjustments']))?> (Original Payouts <?=access_h(fm($paymentLog['totals']['outgoing']))?>; Expense / Purchase Recording Adjustments <?=access_h(fm($paymentLog['totals']['expense_adjustments']))?>; Authorized Payroll Recording Adjustments <?=access_h(fm($paymentLog['totals']['payroll_adjustments']))?>) · Internal Transfers <?=access_h(fm($paymentLog['totals']['transfers']))?></p><p>Recording adjustments do not move money. Expense and purchase adjustments are shown separately from original payouts and contribute by posting date. Original receipt rows remain visible; net receipt totals include the separately dated corrections. Totals cover every matching record. Transfers are separate from sales and payouts. Historical unknown recording actors or refund methods remain unknown. Payroll payouts require salary permission. Historical expenses without an explicit payout record remain available in Expenses; their settlement is not guessed.</p><div class="finance-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Payment / Time</th><th>Direction / Method</th><th>Payer / Payee / Activity</th><th>Amount</th><th>Reference / Status</th><th>Recorded By</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($paymentLog['rows'] as $payment):?><tr><td><?=access_h(ucwords(str_replace('_',' ',$payment['source'])).' #'.$payment['id'])?><br><?=access_h(display_date($payment['recorded_at']))?></td><td><?=access_h(ucfirst($payment['direction']).' / '.strtoupper($payment['method']))?></td><td><?=access_h($payment['payer'])?><br><?=access_h($payment['description'])?><?php if($payment['booking_id']):?><br><a href="<?=access_h(access_url('occupancy.php?booking_id='.(int)$payment['booking_id']))?>">Show Guest Stay Account</a><?php if($payment['can_correct']):?><br><a href="<?=access_h(access_url('financial-corrections.php?payment_id='.(int)$payment['id']))?>#correction-action">Request Correction / View Effective Receipt</a><?php endif;endif?></td><td><?=access_h(fm($payment['amount_minor']))?><?php if(isset($payment['effective'])&&$payment['effective']['last_id']):?><br><small>Current Effective <?=access_h(fm($payment['effective']['amount']).' / '.strtoupper($payment['effective']['method']))?></small><?php endif?></td><td><?=access_h($payment['reference'])?><br><?=access_h($payment['status'])?></td><td><?=access_h($payment['actor_name'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach?><?php if(!$paymentLog['rows']):?><tr><td colspan="6">No payments match this date range.</td></tr><?php endif?></tbody></table></div><p>Page <?=(int)$paymentLog['page']?> of <?=(int)$paymentLog['pages']?> · <?=(int)$paymentLog['totals']['count']?> records</p><div class="finance-buttons"><?php foreach([-1=>'Previous Page',1=>'Next Page'] as $offset=>$label):$next=$paymentLog['page']+$offset;if($next<1||$next>$paymentLog['pages'])continue;?><a href="<?=access_h(finance_url(['page'=>'payments','start'=>$paymentLog['start'],'end'=>$paymentLog['end'],'direction'=>$paymentLog['direction'],'log_page'=>$next]))?>"><?=access_h($label)?></a><?php endforeach?></div></section>
